Comment: The application is linked against the LVGL based cp0_lvgl runtime of the
 CardputerZero launcher by M5Stack (Copyright M5Stack Technology CO LTD, MIT) and LVGL
 (Copyright LVGL Kft, MIT), which are part of the binary and are therefore listed in
 its Copyright field below. The fonts it draws with are the launcher's, read at run
 time from /usr/share/APPLaunch/share/font; none is shipped in this package.
 .
 The game engine (the board, the mine layout generator, the solver behind the hints and the
 fair boards, the statistics and the saved game) and the screen are the app's own code,
 written from scratch for this project from the public idea of a mine-clearing puzzle; it
 contains no code, art or text of other programs of this kind. The layout generator uses
 the SplitMix64 mixing function (Sebastiano Vigna, public domain algorithm), implemented
 here from its published description.

